# Agent scratch/debug pages. These are working surfaces created while building
# a feature (a face lab, a hound preview, a stair probe); they live in the repo
# root because they need the real import map, and they are deliberately NOT
# part of the player experience. `cinematic.html` above is the same idea.
# scripts/validate-no-scratch-pages.mjs enforces that every root HTML file is
# either a real page or excluded here, so a new lab cannot silently deploy.
__*.html
_*.html
soldiers.html
